WEBVTT

00:01.557 --> 00:05.227
<b>Quests that pay well are 
difficult and dangerous.</b>

00:05.227 --> 00:06.487
<b>Do you still want to do this?</b>

00:06.487 --> 00:07.377
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:07.737 --> 00:10.657
<b>Elsie, I can fight now.</b>

00:10.657 --> 00:13.117
<b>We have Rein's enchantments, too.</b>

00:13.377 --> 00:16.627
<b>We'll recruit party members. 
We know some people.</b>

00:16.927 --> 00:19.877
<b>So we'll be okay. Trust us.</b>

00:21.617 --> 00:22.347
<b>Okay.</b>

00:22.987 --> 00:25.547
<b>I'm offering three million for this job.</b>

00:25.547 --> 00:27.297
<b>Three million?</b>

00:27.297 --> 00:31.767
<b>First, all the adventurers died, 
so I raised the reward to 20 million.</b>

00:32.037 --> 00:35.247
<b>Then the village where I 
offered the job was wiped out.</b>

00:35.247 --> 00:38.897
<b>Now I'm offering the job to all 
the neighboring villages...</b>

00:38.897 --> 00:41.237
<b>at 170 million.</b>

00:41.917 --> 00:43.647
<b>Over 100 million?</b>

00:44.257 --> 00:45.457
<b>Well? What'll it be?</b>

00:47.567 --> 00:52.747
<b>Why did the Beast's Fangs, one of the 
big five guilds, instantly collapse?</b>

00:52.747 --> 00:55.097
<b>I heard their gear was 
cursed with weakness!</b>

00:55.097 --> 00:57.497
<b>In the end, it was all just a sham.</b>

00:57.497 --> 01:00.037
<b>Their vice guildmaster went missing, too.</b>

01:00.037 --> 01:03.567
<b>And their adventurers kept failing quests.</b>

01:00.257 --> 01:03.567
<b>Lately, I've been hearing 
that everywhere I go.</b>

01:03.567 --> 01:04.887
<b>Huh...</b>

01:04.237 --> 01:05.867
<b>You gotta hear this new theory!</b>

01:05.867 --> 01:08.657
<b>There was this competent enchanter!</b>

01:08.657 --> 01:11.677
<b>He dispelled all the enchantments 
on their gear and quit!</b>

01:11.677 --> 01:13.277
<b>That's why they collapsed!</b>

01:13.277 --> 01:14.227
<b>No way.</b>

01:14.227 --> 01:15.747
<b>Yeah, right.</b>

01:15.747 --> 01:20.397
<b><i>If rumors about Rein spread, people who 
want him for themselves will show up,</i></b>

01:20.397 --> 01:26.327
<b><i>including nasty people who'd brainwash and
imprison him, and make him enchant gear.</i></b>

01:26.817 --> 01:30.827
<b>Elsie, have you already 
heard about Cornelius?</b>

01:30.827 --> 01:31.577
<b>Huh?</b>

01:31.577 --> 01:36.347
<b>He let it slip that he killed Glenda, 
