01:36.347 --> 01:39.957
<b>and pissed off the man who 
loved her like a parent.</b>

01:39.957 --> 01:42.547
<b>Oh, yeah? What's his name?</b>

01:43.227 --> 01:44.377
<b>Half.</b>

01:44.957 --> 01:50.597
<b>He was always telling people 
that half of him was Glenda.</b>

01:51.027 --> 01:54.267
<b>People have started calling him</b>

01:54.267 --> 01:59.977
<b>and the group that left the 
Beast's Fangs with him...</b>

02:00.907 --> 02:02.397
<b>the THUGs.</b>

02:17.927 --> 02:20.537
