<b>What? Are you here to kidnap my kid?</b>

14:40.527 --> 14:44.947
<b>No. If you're going to force 
Mirabelle to kill people,</b>

14:44.947 --> 14:46.857
<b>then I, D-rank adventurer...</b>

14:46.857 --> 14:49.787
<b>And I, S-rank adventurer 
Lily Flambert, will fight.</b>

14:49.787 --> 14:51.747
<b>I'll kill you pests!</b>

14:51.747 --> 14:53.407
<b>I, head of this eight-person family,</b>

14:53.407 --> 14:56.797
<b>X-rank assassin, and mature lady 
warrior, will kill you myself!</b>

14:56.797 --> 14:58.277
<b>Wait, Mom! Rein!</b>

14:58.277 --> 15:00.297
<b>What are you doing? 
Are you taking their side?</b>

15:00.627 --> 15:04.927
<b>No! I just love you <i>and</i> Rein and Lily!</b>

15:04.927 --> 15:06.177
<b>Shut up!</b>

15:07.137 --> 15:09.137
<b>Hey, what was that for?</b>

15:09.137 --> 15:13.887
<b>I'm going to punish you for 
making a fool out of me.</b>

15:13.887 --> 15:19.397
<b>I'll show you my Super Ultra Lightning 
Hammer, 1,000-yen haircut boy.</b>

15:19.667 --> 15:22.527
<b>But Mom, you said your hand still hurts.</b>

15:24.797 --> 15:29.347
<b>That's not enough to hurt my fist.</b>

15:29.347 --> 15:35.787
<b>I just swallowed my shame and put on 
an act so you'd reflect on your actions.</b>

15:36.427 --> 15:40.797
<b>I can't believe you took it 
seriously. What an idiot.</b>

15:40.797 --> 15:44.797
<b>Stop underestimating your 
mother. I'll kill you.</b>

15:42.697 --> 15:44.797
<b>A-Are you serious?</b>

15:44.797 --> 15:47.117
<b>I won't take it anymore.</b>

15:47.117 --> 15:50.327
<b>I'll find all your family, friends,</b>

15:50.327 --> 15:55.667
<b>and even your guildmaster, 
and Super Ultra the lot of you.</b>

15:55.667 --> 15:57.267
<b>We won't let Elsie die.</b>

15:57.267 --> 15:59.567
<b>What? Elsie?</b>

16:00.147 --> 16:01.757
<b>You mean that Elsie?</b>

16:02.147 --> 16:03.667
<b>You know her?</b>

16:04.277 --> 16:06.667
<b>She's involved?</b>

16:06.667 --> 16:11.287
<b>Suppose killing that 
dumbass Rein takes one.</b>

16:11.287 --> 16:15.617
<b>Lily said she's S-rank, 
right? Then that's two.</b>

16:16.147 --> 16:21.467
<b>Elsie would take three, 
and that's just to start.</b>

16:21.467 --> 16:26.417
<b>She's persistent, so the fighting 
would continue until she dies.</b>

16:26.417 --> 16:32.927
<b>Given that, it'll take an extra 
one, two, three. That's six total.</b>

16:32.927 --> 16:34.297
<b>That sounds about right.</b>

16:36.427 --> 16:42.187
<b>If keeping you around costs me 
this much, then... you know?</b>

16:42.507 --> 16:45.417
<b>The other kids are starting 
to grow up, so whatever.</b>

16:45.417 --> 16:47.137
<b>M-Mom.</b>

16:47.507 --> 16:49.617
<b>Mom! Mom!</b>

16:51.367 --> 16:54.287
<b>You can have her! 
Use her however you want!</b>

16:54.557 --> 16:55.767
<b>Mirabelle!</b>

16:55.767 --> 16:57.397
<b>Mom, wait!</b>

16:57.397 --> 16:59.467
<b>You said you'd do anything for me!</b>

16:59.467 --> 17:02.517
<b>You said you loved me that much!</b>

17:02.517 --> 17:05.047
<b>Why? Why, Mom?</b>

17:05.047 --> 17:07.427
<b>Hey, kids! It's time to eat!</b>

17:07.967 --> 17:10.187
<b>What? You put out too many plates!</b>

17:10.187 --> 17:11.607
<b>What? But there's eight.</b>

17:11.607 --> 17:12.677
<b>Eight is right, right?</b>

17:12.897 --> 17:16.867
<b>What the hell do you mean? 
We're a seven-person family!</b>

17:17.967 --> 17:19.217
<b>Mom...</b>

17:19.217 --> 17:19.807
<b>Mirabelle...</b>

17:20.137 --> 17:22.817
<b>This is my house! Get out, 1,000-yen cut!</b>

17:22.817 --> 17:27.757
<b>Why can't you get just as 
angry and fight for Mirabelle?</b>

17:27.757 --> 17:29.317
<b>Who do you think you are?</b>

17:29.317 --> 17:30.797
<b>Mom, where's our food?</b>

17:30.797 --> 17:32.057
<b>Mom?</b>

17:32.057 --> 17:36.537
<b>Shut up! Don't cry like victims 
who've been made to wait for hours!</b>

17:36.917 --> 17:39.537
<b>Damn it! What's wrong with all of you?</b>

17:39.537 --> 17:41.167
<b>You can all eat shit!</b>

17:41.167 --> 17:44.017
<b>Mom, I love you.</b>

17:51.547 --> 17:53.927
<b>Rein, Lily, Elsie!</b>

17:54.237 --> 17:56.307
<b>Rein, Lily, Elsie!</b>

17:56.777 --> 17:58.807
<b>Rein, Lily, Elsie!</b>

17:59.057 --> 18:01.507
<b>Rein, Lily, Elsie!</b>

18:01.507 --> 18:03.677
<b>Rein, Lily, Elsie!</b>

18:02.837 --> 18:06.797
<b>Th-Thank you for everything.</b>

18:03.727 --> 18:06.027
<b>Rein, Lily, Elsie!</b>

18:09.377 --> 18:11.517
<b>It's ready, Margaret.</b>

18:12.577 --> 18:13.467
<b>Here.</b>

18:13.467 --> 18:16.707
<b>You're making your customers 
wait too long. Are you slacking?</b>

18:16.707 --> 18:18.697
<b>You weren't waiting that long!</b>

18:19.707 --> 18:21.877
EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT

18:19.707 --> 18:21.877
MARGARET ELLS

18:20.417 --> 18:21.877
<b>What is that?</b>

18:21.877 --> 18:24.107
<b>Oh, this? Here, you can see it.</b>

18:24.107 --> 18:26.697
<b>What? You'll give me a year 
of free corn dogs as thanks?</b>

18:26.697 --> 18:28.797
<b>Can you afford to be so generous?</b>

18:29.057 --> 18:32.177
<b>Wow, I'm so glad! Thank you, thank you!</b>

18:32.177 --> 18:33.747
<b>Oh, shut up.</b>

18:34.897 --> 18:36.407
<b>What is this? Your contract?</b>

18:36.407 --> 18:39.777
<b>The Emperor's Shields signs exclusive 
contracts with its adventurers.</b>

18:39.777 --> 18:42.937
<b>They're three-year contracts, 
and this is the renewal period.</b>

18:44.187 --> 18:51.257
<b>Margaret, surely you actually realize you 
should join the Blue Crystals, don't you?</b>

18:52.837 --> 18:54.317
<b>Wh-What? Don't be gross.</b>

18:54.317 --> 18:56.087
<b>You're already bald, 
and that's bad enough.</b>

18:56.087 --> 18:57.247
<b>Enough!</b>

18:58.827 --> 19:00.947
<b>Sorry for calling you bald.</b>

19:00.947 --> 19:02.267
<b>That's not the problem!</b>

19:02.267 --> 19:04.327
<b>How long are you going 
to keep acting like this?</b>

19:04.327 --> 19:06.647
<b>Go ask them to let you join already!</b>

19:07.847 --> 19:12.807
<b>I know it's not easy to say, but 
you can't drag your feet forever.</b>

19:12.807 --> 19:14.427
<b>You can call me bald if you want.</b>

19:14.427 --> 19:15.377
<b>Baldy.</b>

19:15.377 --> 19:16.427
<b>Quit it!</b>

19:16.997 --> 19:17.687
<b>Oh, damn it!</b>

19:17.687 --> 19:18.517
<b>H-Hey!</b>

19:18.907 --> 19:19.597
<b>Wait!</b>

19:19.597 --> 19:21.367
<b>Ugh, something's following me!</b>

19:21.367 --> 19:25.007
<b>You have no right to 
criticize me, Barrius!</b>

19:25.007 --> 19:27.377
<b>I'm just a customer at your food truck!</b>

19:29.367 --> 19:31.527
<b>What? What's wrong?</b>

19:31.527 --> 19:33.197
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

19:33.197 --> 19:34.947
<b>Oh, you were just agreeing with me.</b>

19:34.947 --> 19:38.277
<b>Yeah, our relationship's just 
held together by corn dogs.</b>

19:38.277 --> 19:41.337
<b>But I still want you to be happy.</b>

19:41.337 --> 19:43.207
<b>That's normal as a human being.</b>

19:45.327 --> 19:46.337
<b>Stop imitating me!</b>

19:46.337 --> 19:49.337
<b>Margaret, join the Blue Crystals.</b>

19:50.597 --> 19:52.377
<b>How long are you going 
to keep doing that?!</b>

20:00.517 --> 20:01.747
<b>Wh-What?</b>

20:01.747 --> 20:06.027
<b>If I touch you directly, I'll get sweat 
and grease and shit on my hands.</b>

20:06.027 --> 20:08.397
<b>Am I really that filthy?</b>

20:10.147 --> 20:12.377
<b>I'm holding on to this for today.</b>

20:12.377 --> 20:14.397
<b>Come buy another corn dog.</b>

20:14.397 --> 20:17.407
<b>Until then, take some time 
to think about your future.</b>

20:17.407 --> 20:20.657
<b>But you touched my contract!</b>

20:22.567 --> 20:25.037
<b>Okay, fine. I understand.</b>

20:25.037 --> 20:28.017
<b>Have something other than 
corn dogs ready tomorrow.</b>

20:28.017 --> 20:30.747
<b>See you tomorrow, then. You'd better come.</b>

20:37.407 --> 20:39.927
<b>Wait, Acorn. Not so fast.</b>

20:46.467 --> 20:47.137
<b>Hey.</b>

20:48.607 --> 20:52.467
<b>Hey, it's good to see you. 
How have you been?</b>

21:37.697 --> 21:39.197
LILY

21:43.367 --> 21:44.537
SHE SAID REIN!!

21:43.367 --> 21:44.537
IS SHE...

21:43.367 --> 21:44.537
TALKING ABOUT MEEE?!

21:44.537 --> 21:49.547
TRANSLATION: SHO STIFLER
TIMING: ANDY ELLIS

21:44.537 --> 21:54.997
ROLEPLAYING LIFE

21:50.167 --> 21:55.007
EDITING: ALICIA ASHBY
QUALITY CONTROL: WILLIAM HAGGARD

21:55.007 --> 21:59.757
FINAL QUALITY CONTROL: BECKY COTTRILL

22:05.117 --> 22:05.767
HEY!

22:05.767 --> 22:16.167
REIN CRASHES THE STAGE

22:05.767 --> 22:08.787
YOU WERE TALKING ABOUT ME, RIGHT?!

22:05.767 --> 22:08.787
LILY!!

22:08.787 --> 22:09.537
RIGHT?!

22:09.537 --> 22:10.287
HEY!

22:10.287 --> 22:11.037
LILY!!

22:11.037 --> 22:11.787
HEY!

22:11.787 --> 22:12.537
HEY!!

22:12.537 --> 22:13.287
LILY!!

22:13.287 --> 22:14.037
HEY!!

22:14.037 --> 22:14.787
YOU WERE, RIGHT?!

22:14.787 --> 22:15.537
HEY!!

22:15.537 --> 22:16.167
LILY!!

22:18.067 --> 22:20.657
ROLEPLAYING LIFE

22:18.067 --> 22:18.837
HEY!

22:18.837 --> 22:19.587
LILY!!

22:19.587 --> 22:20.337
HEY!

22:20.337 --> 22:20.657
LILY!!

22:25.407 --> 22:29.957
RUSH

22:25.407 --> 22:29.957
LILY!!

22:25.407 --> 22:29.957
LILY!!

22:25.407 --> 22:29.957
THE BLUE CRYSTALS CRASH THE STAGE!

22:32.657 --> 22:35.407
<b>Hey, miss. Wanna get paid for sex?</b>

22:35.407 --> 22:36.757
<b>It's good money.</b>

22:38.067 --> 22:40.197
<b>So those are the THUGs.</b>

22:41.377 --> 22:44.497
<b><i>Freed from the constraints of their guild,</i></b>

22:44.497 --> 22:46.167
<b><i>these adventurers have turned to crime.</i></b>

22:46.617 --> 22:51.577
<b><i>They'll eventually see Rein's 
enchantments as a possible income source.</i></b>

22:52.147 --> 22:54.157
<b><i>I'll have to keep an eye on them.</i></b>

22:59.237 --> 23:01.487
<b>Trust us.</b>

23:05.327 --> 23:06.987
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

23:08.877 --> 23:11.517
<b><i>They trust me.</i></b>

23:12.307 --> 23:16.297
<b><i>I should believe in their 
intentions and strength, too.</i></b>

23:24.047 --> 23:25.097
<b>I've made my decision.</b>

23:25.927 --> 23:27.927
<b><i>I'll stay in this town</i></b>

23:28.337 --> 23:32.817
<b><i>and eliminate any concerns so 
they can focus on adventuring.</i></b>

23:33.327 --> 23:38.137
<b><i>That is my job as guildmaster.</i></b>
